  "response": "Based on the provided vulnerability description, I will assess the CVSS v3.1 base metric.\n\n**Attack Vector (AV):**\nThe vulnerability allows any authenticated user to delete procedure orders, answers, and specimens belonging to any patient in the system. This can be done without requiring network access or physical proximity, making it a **Network-based attack (N)**.\n\n**Attack Complexity (AC):**\nThe vulnerability requires minimal effort and expertise from an attacker, as they only need to exploit the missing authorization in the AJAX deletion endpoint. Therefore, I assess this as **Low (L)**.\n\n**Privileges Required (PR):**\nAny authenticated user can exploit this vulnerability, regardless of their role. This means that no special privileges are required, making it a **None (N)**.\n\n**User Interaction (UI):**\nThe vulnerability can be exploited without any user interaction, as an attacker only needs to send a request to the affected endpoint. Therefore, I assess this as **None (N)**.\n\n**Scope (S):**\nThe vulnerability affects all users of the system, making it a **System-level attack (U)**.\n\n**Confidentiality Impact (C):**\nAn attacker can delete sensitive information such as procedure orders, answers, and specimens, which could lead to confidentiality breaches. I assess this impact as **High (H)**.\n\n**Integrity Impact (I):**\nThe vulnerability allows an attacker to irreversibly delete data, which could compromise the integrity of the system. I assess this impact as **High (H)**.\n\n**Availability Impact (A):**\nAn attacker can also delete procedure orders and specimens, which could lead to availability issues for users of the system. I assess this impact as **High (H)**.\n\nHere is the calculated CVSS v3.1 base metric:\n\n```\n{\n  \"attack_vector\": \"N\",\n  \"attack_complexity\": \"L\",\n  \"privileges_required\": \"N\",\n  \"user_interaction\": \"N\",\n  \"scope\": \"U\",\n  \"confidentiality_impact\": \"H\",\n  \"integrity_impact\": \"H\",\n  \"availability_impact\": \"H\",\n  \"vector_string\": \"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H\",\n  \"base_score\": 9.8\n}\n```\n\nPlease note that this assessment is based solely on the provided vulnerability description and does not take into account any external knowledge or assumptions.",
